  "howPicksWork": "A slot may be \"pick:<name>\" instead of a search string, which pins the widget to those exact activity ids via data-gyg-tour-ids. Use a pick where the search returns the wrong thing. A probe of all 159 queries on 4 September 2026 (data/gyg-query-probe.json) found 49 where no result was on the subject, several returning other countries entirely - Auckland for a Thames cruise, Venice for the Natural History Museum, Sonoma for Kenwood House. Re-run scripts/probe-gyg-queries.mjs before trusting any query you add.",
